# The default track policy for a `.jcodebuddy/` tree: everything here is derived, machine-written and
# machine-local, so nothing is committed unless this module says otherwise. The one reserved exception
# is `conf/`, which holds what must survive a clone and a commit (DEC-026).
#
# This module currently opts nothing in. `metadata/hipster-ioc/contexts.json` is the dependency graph the
# context generator writes, and it is derived output by definition: it is a rendering of the interfaces,
# so a stale copy in git describes a tree that no longer exists.
*
!.gitignore

# Opt in here when a subtree earns it — and remember the directory must be re-included before anything
# inside it, because git never re-includes a file whose parent directory is excluded:
#
#     !metadata/
#     !metadata/README.md
#
# A `.java` file under `.jcodebuddy/` is always a mistake: generated Java belongs in `src/main/java`
# (DEC-026 § 5), and `GeneratorGuardTest` asserts it.
